{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119696","id":3736315206,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7es6VG","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119696","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119696.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119696.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119696","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119696/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119696/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119696/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/79e8b27d54c769086f1bd252f33f1fa27ffc55df","number":119696,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add UV options for CSGBox3D","user":{"login":"artificioh","id":101995884,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhRVbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101995884?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh","html_url":"https://github.com/artificioh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artificioh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Related: #115926\r\n- Related: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14133\r\n\r\nThis is a small PR that updates how `CSGBox3D` UVs are generated.\r\n- Added `uv_scale` property\r\n- Added `uv_offset` property\r\n- Added `use_size_as_uv` property\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e45ba370-e1b7-4cab-9003-3ef6ac1f132d\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c878a2d0-1ab6-47db-afae-a01c826b4900\r\n\r\n\r\nIt also works with flip faces, boolean operations and baked mesh instances.\r\n<img width=\"1925\" height=\"999\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4d0bd9f2-e824-4f9f-871b-373034ba7108\" />\r\n<img width=\"1165\" height=\"833\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/473c1ffb-b6b5-4b77-8bba-e12b7edd1bb3\" />\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"970\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c6c2187a-da09-4875-b473-cb63028c9c22\" />\r\n\r\n### How it works\r\nPreviously, box UVs were generated from a fixed layout, regardless of face orientation.\r\n\r\nThis changes UV generation to derive coordinates from `face_points`, which contains the normalized vertex positions for the face. The U and V axes are selected based on the side index `i`, where values 0 through 5 correspond to +X, +Y, +Z, -X, -Y, and -Z. Negative sides (`i >= 3`) mirror the U coordinate to keep orientation consistent.\r\n\r\nThe aligned UVs are then scaled by `uv_size`, which is based on `size` when `use_size_as_uv` is enabled, or `Vector3(1, 1, 1)` otherwise, and finally multiplied by `uv_scale`, with `uv_offset` being applied in the end.\r\n\r\n### AI usage\r\nAI was used to rephrase the documentation for the new properties and to help explain the original code, specifically the `face_points` calculations.\r\n\r\n### Edit:\r\n(previous title: Add UV scaling and size-based mapping to CSGBox3D)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color